# Debug logs directory

This directory stores WhatsApp and email automation debug files when DEBUG_ENABLED=true in .env

Debug files are automatically generated here when errors occur:
- `whatsapp_debug_<phone>_<tag>.html` - Full page HTML snapshots
- `whatsapp_debug_<phone>_<tag>.png` - Screenshots

These files are useful for troubleshooting but should not be committed to version control.
See .gitignore to keep this directory clean.
